<div class="titleband" data-screen-label="The Case — title"><h1>The <span class="u-1">Case</span></h1></div>
<div class="introband">
  <h2>The receipts behind <span class="u-1">every claim</span> we make.</h2>
  <p>The Case is Uncost&rsquo;s evidence layer — built to be useful to supporters, journalists, researchers, urban planners, funders, and skeptics alike. It covers what humans need, what those needs cost by region, where automation and shared infrastructure can plausibly help, and the open methodology behind every claim.</p>
</div>

